============================================================================
GF(2) COCHAIN COMPLEX of the PSL(2,7) left-right square complex; certificate soundness
============================================================================
  [(2,3,7) x <7>] |A|=3,|B|=2: V=168, E=420, F=252
    rank d0=167, rank d1=239;  Betti  b0=1  b1=14  b2=13
    => b1=14>0 => 14 nontrivial certificate class(es) the local test can't see
  [6 involutions x <7>] |A|=6,|B|=2: V=168, E=672, F=504
    rank d0=167, rank d1=455;  Betti  b0=1  b1=50  b2=49
